  "$description": "Single source of truth for NectarLink design tokens. QML (desktop) and Compose (Android) themes are generated from this file. Bloom colors follow Material You tonal roles; at runtime the Android app derives them from the wallpaper and sends the seed to the PC (hello.device.accent). The palettes here are the fallbacks and brand presets.",
